From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 11:59:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] keyboard redesign

Redesigned DialogKeyboard: re-centred layout, reworked rows and
navigation (no wrap-up into the edit line), outline/solid OK, cancel and
spacebar key textures, and a tiny font6 (added to both fontsets) for the
hidden label of the layout-language button. Touches DialogKeyboard.xml,
Font.xml, media/keyboard/.
